      "text": "Pursuant to the provisions of Administrative Code, section B19-7.651, as amended by L. 1964, c. 636, the Mayor, by this Executive Order adopted prior to June 1, 1964, hereby directs that beginning with the first full payroll period following July 1, 1964 and ending with the payroll period immediately prior to that the first day of which is nearest to June 30, 1965, the contribution of each member of the Fire Department Pension Fund, Article 1-B made pursuant to section B19-7.65 of the Administrative Code, shall be reduced by 2-1/2 per centum of the compensation of such member.",
